 of very different people  forced to share space and trust in one  another  almost every character in the film is an  archetype the sex worker with the heart  of gold the reformed outlaw and the  drunken doctor to name just a few  but what makes stagecoach work so well  is how it throws these archetypes  together in different situations and  combinations  it isn't an overly action-packed film  it's more of a character drama that  weaves a tale about the mythology of the  old west  highlighted here and there by wild  chases and a few good shootouts  so if you want to experience a classic  western and see where the genre comes  from stagecoach is an excellent choice  many film fans consider high noon to be  the first true adult western one that  examines the morals of the old west and  explores the psychology of the men and  women living on the frontier  this 1952 movie also won several academy  awards including best actor for star  gary cooper  as for the film itself it's a tense  paired down western that explores the  nature of duty and morality  all through one man's desperate attempts  to stay alive high noon stars cooper as  marshall will kane a man who's getting  married and is about to retire but right  as he's preparing to set out for a new  life he learns that an outlaw he put  behind bars has been released and is  coming to town to exact revenge  his new wife played by grace kelly tries  to get him to leave but he refuses to  run  instead kane tries to round up a group  of men to help him fight unfortunately  he slowly learns that the town has  turned against him too cowardly to help  and fearful that they'll only get  themselves killed in the process  so kane decides to make a solitary final  stand at high noon when his nemesis  comes into town  compared to modern westerns high noon  may seem a bit slow but it features some  powerful and famous scenes like an  iconic crane shot showing how a lone  kane really is  whether you're a fan of westerns or not  this is a thoughtful and suspenseful  film that everyone should see  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movie genres are coming  soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  you

